start     book
terminals word

# A book somebody put away as unfit, kept in the D'ni city's quarantine chamber (design §4.2). The one
# found book allowed to argue with itself: BookCheck fails any book here that comes out coherent. Each
# alternative should be a mistake a reader can see in the world and learn to recognise in their own.
#
# Three kinds, by how far gone the Age is, and none of them near collapse (50). BookCheck holds every one
# between the phenomena's floor (4) and collapse, and UnstableBookCheck holds each kind to its band.
# - Slightly unstable, 4 to 12: one mistake. Seams, a wound or two, a phenomenon starting.
# - Moderately unstable, 13 to 29: two or three mistakes.
# - Severely unstable, 30 to 49: mistakes stacked until the wounds go on opening (from 30).

book = [slightly_unstable] | [moderately_unstable] | [severely_unstable]

slightly_unstable =
    age [land] landmass villagers ruins structures
    | age arid landmass flooded rock
    | age [land] landmass molten sea verdant biomes
    | age [land] landmass blizzard inferno weather
    | age [land] landmass trees features arid climate
    | age [land] landmass drowned sea dry rock
    | age colossal minuscule landmass

moderately_unstable =
    age colossal minuscule landmass blizzard inferno weather
    | age arid landmass flooded rock drenched weather blizzard inferno weather
    | age [cold_stone] landmass frozen scorching climate molten sea verdant biomes
    | age villagers ruins structures trees features arid climate drowned sea dry rock

severely_unstable =
    age colossal minuscule landmass frozen scorching climate molten sea verdant biomes
    | age colossal minuscule landmass villagers ruins structures frozen scorching climate molten sea verdant biomes
    | age frozen scorching tropical climate blizzard inferno weather molten sea verdant biomes

land = gentle | eroded | insular | pillared | canyoned | mountainous

cold_stone = packed_ice | snow_block
